  "notes": [
    "Addresses are the numbers of the manual's tables, which start at 0 (address base 0); the clock registers skip 3 and 10.",
    "The input coils are listed in the manual's table as 0 to 3 while the text says coils 1 to 4: the table is followed here.",
    "RS-232 or RS-485, Modbus RTU, 300 to 9600 bps; factory 9600 8N1, address 18 (settable 1 to 247 from the configuration menu).",
    "The manual's tables are images; transcribed by reading them. Written from the manual, not tested on a device."
  ],
